COPY public.questions (id, question_text, media_image, media_video, correct_answer, media_audio, question_description, hint) FROM stdin;
12	You Are So Close, Yet So Far	\N	\N	XIII:00	\N	The journey begins when you've registered for what you are playing now. The answer is closer than you think — it’s already tied to what you’ve shared. It might be in a space you don’t often visit, a place where things sometimes slip through unnoticed. Look carefully at what you've already received, and you’ll find the next step waiting	\N
3	Fractured Reality\n	\N	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/video/upload/v1743188539/2_gni92q.mp4,https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/video/upload/v1743188463/1_vtidnk.mp4}	Schizophrenia	\N	\r\nTwo windows into the same world—yet, they don’t reflect the same truth.\r\nA whisper that no one else hears, a shadow that moves without a source.\r\nOne path leads to clarity, the other to confusion.\r\nAre the pieces missing, or were they never there?\r\n	\N
11	Story of Hyphen 1962\n	\N	\N	TYPO123\n	\N	I am the ghoste in the mecine, unseen yet strong,\nA single misstap, and everything goes rong.\nI mimic logic, yet bring only dispair,\nA hunt for me fills nights with b1ank staires.\n\nI thirve where keys are preesed in haste,\nA tiny flaw, yet none to waaste.\nWritters may curse me, but there’s more to my gaem—\nThose who debugg know me by naem.\n\nWhat am I?\n\n	Hint:Questions open doors, and one person holds the key. You may have uncovered the problem, but the solution remains out of reach. Find the one who knows the answers before they're even asked—but to unlock the key, you must speak the right words
8	The scrambled lyrics	\N	\N	The scrambled lyrics	\N	The present deceives the eyes, just as these lyrics deceive the mind. Shuffled and distorted, they hide their true form. Can you see beyond the illusion and restore what’s lost?	Hint:Irshad -\nHar sawaal mein hoon, phir bhi adhoora sa reh jaata hoon,\nTeri nazron ke saamne hoon, par ek saaya ban jaata hoon\nJo dikh raha hai, wahi ek paheli hai,\nSamajh sake to raah bhi yahin milta hai\n\n
7	The Paradox of Nothing	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/image/upload/v1743189916/Screenshot_2025-03-29_at_12.54.55_AM_vkgw2g.png}	\N	Answer	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/video/upload/v1743189301/silence_no_sound_v0mxbg.mp3}	Deep within the archives of the lost vault, a forgotten phrase holds the key to unimaginable treasures. Many have tried, offering words of wisdom, numbers, even ancient incantations... yet all have failed. Only those who truly understand the nature of the void shall succeed\nWhat is the secret phrase that unlocks the vault?	Hint : Silence is not empty; it is full of answers
14	Dun dun dun dun….	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/image/upload/v1743283239/Screenshot_2025-03-30_at_2.27.07_AM_blkrzs.png}	\N	Marvel Rivals	\N		\N
10	F*** around and Find out	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/image/upload/v1743282717/1111_idr6s5.jpg}	\N	SOCIAL MEDIA	\N	The first piece of the puzzle lies within the familiar. Unlock the next step by finding us on Instagram @DCODE (or scan the QR) — your journey begins there.\n	\N
5	Beyond the Dots\r\n\r\n	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/image/upload/v1743189629/Screenshot_2025-03-29_at_12.50.22_AM_fefovt.png}	\N	DCODE	\N	The path to understanding is laid out within the rules, guiding you to a familiar place. Yet, sometimes, meaning isn’t found in the pattern itself but in what frames it. Let your gaze drift beyond the expected.\r\n\r\nI thrive where keys are pressed in haste,\r\nA tiny flaw, yet none to waste.\r\nWriters may curse me, but there’s more to my game—\r\nThose who debug know me by name.\r\n\r\nWhat am I?\r\n	
2	Harmonic Chroma	\N	\N	Olympics\n	\N	    Five silent echoes, bound yet free—hidden in light, revealed in motion. Seek them in the cycle of color, where unity takes form unseen, and the stage is the greatest.\n#CFF4BE, #F2C8B8, #EAE4CE, #C3DCD6, #D2B4C3\n	Hint: keep them together!\n
15	Horizon	\N	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/video/upload/v1743275962/Tudung_zeh7ql.mp4}	Titanic	\N		\N
9	Silent Void	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/image/upload/v1743189497/Screenshot_2025-03-29_at_12.48.05_AM_mwid6a.png}	\N	garage	\N		\N
4	Failure is the key to success, Blaise de	\N	\N	decoder	\N	Whv eeo zjhtie dl raf eactck ulrx vmn ieio btxs frok, znu nhcq mgf pncq btogr. Cl, si esjx ampo nhwm bhxr wejn nq hbgk si esjx gsfq yc em si kyzz rn wpaa nlug kyzz ampo nhwm bhxr hz ampo mf ilsk mefd mylt. pn ky grcey tmuhmc hzrjtmph\r\n	\N
6	Oi Manash…..	\N	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/video/upload/v1743272731/oiiii_manash_g2a4cj.mp4}	bougainvillea	\N		\N
13	Can you see the music, Robert?	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/image/upload/v1743272777/Screenshot_2025-03-29_at_11.54.04_PM_cvchie.png}	\N	soundscape	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/video/upload/v1743272974/peepoopeepoo_cdpmiv.wav}		\N
1	The Clockmaker's Code	{https://res.cloudinary.com/dqy7g6dzv/image/upload/v1743189968/Screenshot_2025-03-29_at_12.56.00_AM_ttbxej.png}	\N	2457	\N	In a quiet town, a wise old clockmaker designed a special timepiece with four gears, each numbered. He left behind a cryptic note, hinting at the secret to unlocking its mechanism: \r\n"The first gear is small but crucial, setting everything in motion. The second is twice as fast, always moving at double the pace of the first. The third, eager to outshine the second, always pushes one step ahead. And the fourth? It carries the wisdom of the first and third combined, keeping the entire system balanced. Together, their energy amounts to eighteen ticks, no more, no less. Only by aligning them perfectly will the great clock’s secret be revealed."\r\n	\N
\.


